---
import styles from './Intro.module.scss';
---

<header id="home" class={styles.intro} data-intro>
  <p class={styles.eyebrow}>Lead Web Engineer application for Genki</p>
  <h1 class={styles.name} tabindex="-1">
    Liam Trubshaw
  </h1>
  <div class={styles.copy}>
    <p class={styles.lede}>
      I'm a hands-on engineering lead in London. I've owned technical direction at TwoTen Studio for
      8 years while building every week, and this year I took Frame Foundry from idea to paying
      customers in 6 months.
    </p>
    <p>
      I built this page the way I'd work at Genki, with Claude Code, clear guardrails and a safe
      deploy pipeline.
    </p>
  </div>
  {/* Only shown on the map, where the intro is the welcome panel. */}
  <button type="button" class={styles.start} data-game-start>
    Start flying
  </button>
</header>
